# {{ title }}

Raw BIDS dataset converted by faire from the sourcedata streams in `sourcedata/`, one
session per pull request.

| Rule | Source | Writes |
|---|---|---|
| `heudiconv` | `{{ dicom_stream }}` | `sub-*/ses-*` |
{%- if physio_stream %}
| `phys2bids` | `{{ physio_stream }}` | `sub-*/ses-*/func/*_physio.*` |
{%- endif %}
{%- if eyetrack_stream %}
| `eye2bids` | `{{ eyetrack_stream }}` | `sub-*/ses-*/func/*_recording-eye*_physio.*` |
{%- endif %}
{%- if mrs_stream %}
| `spec2nii` | `{{ mrs_stream }}` | `sub-*/ses-*/mrs/*` |
{%- endif %}
{%- if ephys_stream %}
| `mne-bids` | `{{ ephys_stream }}` | `sub-*/ses-*/{meg,eeg,ieeg}` |
{%- endif %}
| `deface` | this dataset | `sub-*/ses-*/anat` (in place) |

The bids-validator check blocks the merge of a session and the release.
Containers and conversion heuristics come from `code/containers`.
